  "unit": "Possession, grouped by offensive lineup interval.",
  "sample": "All offensive possessions from NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, and 2024-25 regular seasons and playoffs. Focus on intervals where the offensive five changes, comparing the shot mix immediately before and after the change. Filter for lineups with a minimum threshold of possessions (e.g., 50 or 100) to ensure sufficient data for shot mix estimation.",
