  "controls": "To address confounding, a difference-in-differences approach or a regression model with fixed effects for game, team, opponent, and possibly game state (score margin, time remaining) will be used. Compare shot mix of team A's lineup X to team A's lineup Y, controlling for the opponent and game context. Consider using matched samples of possessions where only the offensive lineup changes, keeping other factors as constant as possible.",
