  "multiplicity": "Multiple comparisons will arise from examining changes across several shot location categories and potentially numerous lineup changes. Apply a False Discovery Rate (FDR) control method (e.g., Benjamini-Hochberg) for p-value adjustment.",
  "decision_rule": "The hypothesis will be considered supported if a statistically significant change (p < 0.05 after multiplicity adjustment) in at least one key shot mix category (e.g., 3-point attempt rate, restricted area attempt rate) is consistently observed following a lineup change, across a meaningful number of lineup transitions, and after controlling for confounding factors. The effect size must also be practically meaningful (e.g., >2 percentage points change in a shot category).",
  "data_version": "NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25 regular season and playoffs play-by-play, substitution rotation intervals, starters, defensive matchup minutes, box-score summary. Derived play-type possession records."
 }

